  "summary": {
    "as": "Introduced in House",
    "asOf": "2025-02-21",
    "date": "2026-08-27T16:58:04Z",
    "text": "Protecting Investors' Personally Identifiable Information Act\n\nThis bill limits certain disclosures of personally identifiable information belonging to a participant in the securities market for purposes of tracking market activity.\n\nSpecifically, the bill prohibits the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) from requiring a national securities exchange, a national securities association, or a member of such an exchange or association to provide such information to satisfy the reporting requirements of the Consolidated Audit Trail (data used by regulators to track market activity).\u00a0"
  },
